===Etymology===
{{inh+|cs|sla-pro|*berzьnъ||March; April}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*berza||birch}}, which starts to bud (and give sap) in March,<ref>{{R:cs:Rejzek 2007}}</ref><ref name="machek">{{R:cs:Machek 1968}}</ref> + {{m|sla-pro|*-ьnъ}}. Alternatively, it might be derived from {{m|cs|březí||gravid}}, because livestock are usually pregnant ("gravid") in March.<ref name="machek" />

